# Direct runtime dependencies for backend/agent/runtime_entrypoint.py, the
# AgentCore Runtime deployment package's entry point. Scoped to exactly
# what's imported by the real code path (graph.py -> preflight/retrieve/
# reason nodes -> shared/clients, shared/models, corpus/lexical_index) —
# confirmed by grep, not copied from backend/pyproject.toml's full dependency
# list. beautifulsoup4/pypdf/python-hcl2 are ingestion-only and deliberately
# excluded; they are never imported by anything reachable from this
# entrypoint.
#
# Bounds match backend/pyproject.toml so both environments stay consistent.
# Compile to runtime_requirements.lock.txt with build_runtime_package.py's
# --relock flag (uv pip compile --python-platform aarch64-manylinux2014
# --python-version 3.12) — this file alone is not what gets installed for a
# real build; the lock is.
